[{"op":"callScene","scene":6900,"entry":2},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1108],"value":0},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1109],"value":4},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1110],"value":18},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1111],"value":5},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",1112],"value":1},{"op":"background","image":"bg009"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",303],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"朝阳刺得眼睛生疼。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啊…我起这么早干什么呢。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"完完全全能赶上上课时间。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（我也不是因为想要迟到，才这样的…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"起床，换衣服。"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg010"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"跨过打着呼噜的父亲，穿过客厅。"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg033a"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"和往日不太一样…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"大批同校的学生走在路上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（不过，这才是正常的景象吧。）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"学生","text":"「早。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"学生","text":"「早呀。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"听着往来的问候声，我呆站着…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"没有一个人向我打招呼。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"每一个人，都只是欢笑着从我身边走过。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"没有一个人注意到了我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"所以即便我折返回去，也没人会在意我去哪，更不会有人叫住我。"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":86,"condition":["==",["v","f",2],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（还是闪人算了…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"声","text":"「你要去哪里？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"有人拉着我的衣服说到。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"看来有人注意到了我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那一定是我的伙伴。同样是，住在透明世界的居民。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng16"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「冈崎同学，学校在这个方向。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你说得对。是我弄错了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「怎么会弄错呢。大家都是往这边走的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我看到这种场景，就会想要和别人反着来。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「不可以哦。好不容易能不迟到了…我们一起上学吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在人群中，和女孩肩并肩一起上学…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"只是想想，就足以让我起一身鸡皮疙瘩。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你先走吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng33"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「我不会先走的。如果冈崎同学不来，我就一直在这里等你。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「那会迟到的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「没关系。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg033"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"在我们僵持的时间里…路上的学生越来越少。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…再不走就真要迟到了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng32"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「现在走还来得及。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「是吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「是的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不是没人会注意我的吗？"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我也没必要故意显摆，让别人注意到我。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「…那快走吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng10"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「好的。」"},{"op":"background","image":"bg011"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":82,"condition":["==",["v","f",202],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"坡道上…一名女生抬头凝望着天空。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那是我认识的人，所以不由得停下了脚步。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgng14"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「冈崎同学，你怎么了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"古河","text":"「那位同学…是你的朋友吗。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不，其实不是…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「走吧。」"},{"op":"goto","to":85},{"op":"ifFalse","to":85,"condition":["==",["v","f",202],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"今天依旧攀登着坡道。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"为了再一次拨动，改变日常的齿轮。"},{"op":"goto","to":109},{"op":"ifFalse","to":109,"condition":["==",["v","f",2],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"可是…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"如果期待一成不变的日常有所改变的话…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说不定还是笔直向前走比较好。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（就仅限今天吧…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"整理好了思绪，再次向前迈进。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg011"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":107,"condition":["==",["v","f",202],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"坡道上…一名女生抬头凝望着天空。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那是我认识的人，所以不由得停下了脚步。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"风吹起长长的秀发，不禁让人看得入迷。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不久其他女生跟她打招呼，这才回过神来，脸上挂起微笑。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"缓缓攀登着坡道。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"听见了预备铃的声音。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（都到这里了。可千万别迟到啊…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我也朝着校门走去。"},{"op":"goto","to":109},{"op":"ifFalse","to":109,"condition":["==",["v","f",202],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":111,"condition":["==",["v","f",208],1]},{"op":"callScene","scene":2418,"entry":0},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg021a"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",312],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":119,"condition":["==",["v","f",3],1]},{"op":"callScene","scene":6418,"entry":0},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"callScene","scene":3418,"entry":0},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg021"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",312],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"下午上课的铃声响起，大家都坐到了座位上。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"杏也跑出了教室。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg021a"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg021b"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"声","text":"「喂，冈崎。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一下课就听到班主任在叫我，当做没听到吧。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"班主任","text":"「听到没啊，冈崎。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"好烦啊。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「什么事。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一脸莫名地抬起头。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"班主任走到了我的面前。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"班主任","text":"「春原去哪了？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「春原？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我看了看旁边。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"确实不见了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不知道啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"班主任","text":"「能去帮我把他找回来吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「咦？我去？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"班主任","text":"「没错，冈崎就是你。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「为什么啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"班主任","text":"「我觉得你应该知道他在哪的。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我不知道啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"班主任","text":"「这样啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"班主任","text":"「那你就代替他来一次吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「去哪。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"班主任","text":"「当然是办公室。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「什么事。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"班主任","text":"「冈崎，你迟到了多少次心里有数吗？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「但我不像春原那么过分，好歹上午就来了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"班主任","text":"「你这就叫五十步笑百步。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"班主任","text":"「总之，春原不在的话，就该你去了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「唉…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"真是让人心烦。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"仔细想想能够逃掉接下来的课，果然老老实实去找春原才是上策。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我知道了，我这就去找。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"转身，迈步。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"班主任","text":"「喂，冈崎，我可没让你现在就去，下课了再给我去找！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"装作没听到最后那句话。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"就算被追究翘课的责任，也可以甩给班主任。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg018"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"没记错的话，午休的时候春原应该还在。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"但是有没有上第五节课就不清楚了。我整节课都在睡觉。"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":180,"condition":["==",["v","f",302],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"说来不是被橄榄球部那群家伙带走了吗。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（那应该是在哪个角落里怀疑人生…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一想到这个就懒得去找了。"},{"op":"goto","to":184},{"op":"ifFalse","to":184,"condition":["==",["v","f",302],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（只丢下了那句会比我们BIG…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（鬼知道他去哪了…）"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"懒得去找了。"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":186,"condition":["==",["v","f",130],1]},{"op":"callScene","scene":1418,"entry":0},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg020"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",313],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"到处溜达也差不多腻了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"想想春原可能会去的地方。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「………」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"毫无头绪。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"老实说他爱去哪去哪。"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":231,"condition":["||",["==",["v","f",404],1],["==",["v","f",130],1]]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我只要差不多时间回去上课就行了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"去想去的地方吧。"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":207,"condition":["&&",["==",["v","f",404],1],["==",["v","f",130],0]]},{"op":"choice","id":"418:30970","target":["v","f",1089],"items":[{"text":"图书室","value":0,"serial":30970},{"text":"回教室","value":1,"serial":30980}]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":204,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],0]},{"op":"goto","to":218},{"op":"goto","to":206},{"op":"ifFalse","to":206,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],1]},{"op":"goto","to":227},{"op":"goto","to":230},{"op":"ifFalse","to":215,"condition":["&&",["==",["v","f",404],0],["==",["v","f",130],1]]},{"op":"choice","id":"418:31050","target":["v","f",1089],"items":[{"text":"空教室","value":0,"serial":31050},{"text":"回教室","value":1,"serial":31060}]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":212,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],0]},{"op":"goto","to":222},{"op":"goto","to":214},{"op":"ifFalse","to":214,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],1]},{"op":"goto","to":227},{"op":"goto","to":230},{"op":"ifFalse","to":230,"condition":["&&",["==",["v","f",404],1],["==",["v","f",130],1]]},{"op":"choice","id":"418:31130","target":["v","f",1089],"items":[{"text":"图书室","value":0,"serial":31130},{"text":"空教室","value":1,"serial":31140},{"text":"回教室","value":2,"serial":31150}]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":221,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],0]},{"op":"callScene","scene":4418,"entry":0},{"op":"goto","to":268},{"op":"goto","to":230},{"op":"ifFalse","to":226,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],1]},{"op":"callScene","scene":1418,"entry":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"唔，还是回去吧…。"},{"op":"goto","to":233},{"op":"goto","to":230},{"op":"ifFalse","to":230,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],2]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"这样也挺麻烦的。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"回去睡个回笼觉吧…。"},{"op":"goto","to":233},{"op":"goto","to":233},{"op":"ifFalse","to":233,"condition":["&&",["==",["v","f",404],0],["==",["v","f",130],0]]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"回去算了…。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"…刚要往回走我突然想到一个地方。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"旧教学楼有一个绝佳的地方可以睡觉。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"那就是…一楼的资料室。"},{"op":"choice","id":"418:31330","target":["v","f",1089],"items":[{"text":"去睡一会儿","value":0,"serial":31330},{"text":"还是回教室吧","value":1,"serial":31340}]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":266,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],0]},{"op":"callScene","scene":5418,"entry":0},{"op":"ifFalse","to":256,"condition":["==",["v","f",502],0]},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg021"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",313],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"回到教室后依然不见春原的踪影。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（随他去吧…）"},{"op":"background","image":"bg021a"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg021h"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"放学之后春原还是没有回来。"},{"op":"goto","to":264},{"op":"ifFalse","to":264,"condition":["==",["v","f",502],1]},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg021h"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",313],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"回到教室后依然不见春原的踪影。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"（随他去吧…）"},{"op":"goto","to":278},{"op":"goto","to":268},{"op":"ifFalse","to":268,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"早知道还是去上课的好。即便是去睡觉。"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg021a"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",313],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"………。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg021h"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"放学后春原还是没有回来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不过这也不是什么稀奇的事情，没什么好在意的。"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":291,"condition":["==",["v","f",3],1]},{"op":"background","image":"bg018"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我独自走向演剧部的活动室。"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":284,"condition":["==",["v","f",210],1]},{"op":"callScene","scene":2418,"entry":1},{"op":"callScene","scene":6418,"entry":1},{"op":"ifFalse","to":288,"condition":["==",["v","f",9],1]},{"op":"goto","to":484},{"op":"goto","to":290},{"op":"ifFalse","to":290,"condition":["==",["v","f",9],0]},{"op":"goto","to":297},{"op":"goto","to":297},{"op":"ifFalse","to":297,"condition":["==",["v","f",3],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我独自离开了教室。"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":297,"condition":["==",["v","f",210],1]},{"op":"background","image":"bg018"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"callScene","scene":2418,"entry":1},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后到了夜晚。"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":368,"condition":["&&",["==",["v","f",630],1],["==",["v","f",631],1]]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我和平时一样走去学生宿舍。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg045n"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",317],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"刚走过玄关…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"咚咚咚咚咚…地面又开始震动了起来。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"声","text":"「闪开闪开！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"橄榄球部的那些家伙纷纷逃回自己的房间。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgms21"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"美佐枝","text":"「你们这些家伙ーーーー」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"每次在后面追赶的都是美佐枝小姐。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgms20"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"美佐枝","text":"「那群家伙，真是的…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美佐枝","text":"「居然自己住着的宿舍都不肯好好打扫…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美佐枝","text":"「小学生都知道要打扫啊…」"},{"op":"choice","id":"418:31770","target":["v","f",1089],"items":[{"text":"上前搭话","value":0,"serial":31770},{"text":"目送离开","value":1,"serial":31780}]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":357,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「所以说还是对他们太好了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgms15"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"美佐枝","text":"「那该怎么办呢。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「缓缓地抓住对方的双腿。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgms19"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"美佐枝","text":"「缓缓就抓不住了吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「然后以自己为中心旋转。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「将对方甩出去，让他们像抹布一样和地板来个亲密接触，以后就知道宿舍有多脏了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"美佐枝","text":"「这种漫画必杀技一样的事怎么可能做得到啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"嘎吱。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh10b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「啊，美佐枝小姐，正好要找你。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「我房间的空罐头里面爬出很多神秘的虫子，你有杀虫剂吗。」"},{"op":"callScene","scene":1,"entry":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"转啊转啊转啊飞ーーーーーーーーーーーーー！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原的身体夸张地在走廊翻滚。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgms17"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"美佐枝","text":"「原来如此…试一下才发现也不是做不到呢…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgms18"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"美佐枝","text":"「你们几个，给我认真打扫自己的房间。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"ifFalse","to":350,"condition":["==",["v","f",302],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一边拍着手一边走开了。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh27b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「不好，搞出这么大动静会被发现的啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"春原倒是灰头土脸地跑了过来。"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「怎么了，发生什么事了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"接着我们进入了房间。"},{"op":"goto","to":355},{"op":"ifFalse","to":355,"condition":["==",["v","f",302],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"一边拍着手一边走开了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"然后在她走过去的地方…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"声","text":"「哇啊啊啊啊啊啊ーーーーーーー！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"响起了其他的悲鸣声。"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",632],"value":1},{"op":"goto","to":364},{"op":"ifFalse","to":364,"condition":["==",["v","f",1089],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"不管我怎么建议，这个人还是这么心软。我决定不再管她。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgms13"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"美佐枝","text":"「唉…」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"美佐枝小姐耸了耸肩，事情也就告一段落了。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我看完热闹便走进了春原的房间。"},{"op":"background","image":"bg046n"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",313],"value":1},{"op":"goto","to":373},{"op":"ifFalse","to":373,"condition":["||",["==",["v","f",630],0],["==",["v","f",631],0]]},{"op":"background","image":"bg046n"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"set","target":["v","z",313],"value":1},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我和平时一样来到了春原的房间。"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":425,"condition":["==",["v","f",302],1]},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh18b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「听好了…今天要安静一点…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「为什么。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh16b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「因为…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「…今天是安静日。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「宿舍里面还有这种规矩？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你声音太大了啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"基本上对付橄榄球部采取的都是装不在大法。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「别管他们了，来狂欢吧。嗨到天亮。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh27b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「求你别这样。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「来玩以前一直玩的踩图钉尖叫游戏吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「就没玩过这种游戏好吗！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「好，猜拳输掉的春原，要去踩图钉啦。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh27b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「什么叫输掉的春原…那输掉的冈崎呢！？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「好，我们开始吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「哎？」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「剪刀石头布！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh25b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「好，我赢了！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「该死。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「再来一次，剪刀石头布！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh25b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「好，我连胜了！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你赶紧输掉去踩图钉啊，剪刀石头布！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh25b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「怎么样，三连胜！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「喂，非要我去踩图钉这猜拳游戏才算完吗！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「没错。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「这绝对是欺负人好吧！」"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"啪！"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"门被用力打开。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「咕啊ー」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"橄榄球部员","text":"「你小子…果然在啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"橄榄球部的各位笔挺地站着。"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你太吵了啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"橄榄球部员","text":"「好，来我的房间，我们好好交流下。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「唔…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"掐住脖子…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"呜哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊ーー－ーーーーーーー…"},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"直接被拖走了。"},{"op":"goto","to":484},{"op":"ifFalse","to":484,"condition":["==",["v","f",302],0]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你今天溜了吧。」"},{"op":"ifFalse","to":429,"condition":["==",["v","f",632],1]},{"op":"text","speaker":"","text":"我对灰头土脸跑回来的春原说到。"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「嗯，你指什么。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你有数的吧，班主任一直在找你啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我差点就成你的替罪羊了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh12b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你也不容易呀。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你觉得是因为谁啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「不管怎么样，大家同为迟到党，就互相帮助一下吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「顺带一提要退学的话也是你先，从那个时间点开始我就会好好去上课的。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh24b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「嗯？」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你就是退学计量表。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「说不定已经到了再迟到一次就要退学的程度了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「哈哈…那还真是刺激。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「要是你明天真的老老实实去上课了就好笑了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「谁会去啊…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「但是，今天我也很困了，差不多该睡了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你还真是胆小啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh18b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「嗯？你刚才说了什么…再说一次试试。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「啥？大变态。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「没说吧！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你说了胆小吧！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「啊，我有说吗。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh18b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你都这么说了，我明天就堂堂正正迟到给你看…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「话说你可以请假啊。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我想想，就请一星期…不，一个月吧…」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「索性就别来了吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「那不就是自主退学嘛！」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「也可以这么说。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh18b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「哈…让你见识下我为什么是超越常识的人。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「因为已经超脱了人的范围。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh23b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「你什么意思啊。」"},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"background","image":"bg046n"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「我也差不多该回去了。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「已经要回去睡觉觉了吗。朋也弟弟真是小孩子。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你还不睡啊。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh25b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「当然了，我准备通宵玩游戏书。小鹿乱撞心跳不已的大冒险。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「你才是小孩子吧。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「哈…真心困了。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「走啦，你也差不多睡吧。」"},{"op":"bodies","images":["cgsh13b"]},{"op":"text","speaker":"春原","text":"「哈…我又不是小孩子。怎么可能睡觉。」"},{"op":"text","speaker":"朋也","text":"「不睡觉会死的。」"},{"op":"set","target":["v","f",810],"value":1},{"op":"background","image":"kuro"},{"op":"bodies","images":[]},{"op":"jumpScene","scene":419,"entry":0},{"op":"return"}]